  "adaptation": [
    "New HIGH sheep anatomy retains organic shoulders, chest, haunches, knees, hocks, fetlocks and the four generated cloven feet. No prior taotie torso or primitive legs/hooves are reused.",
    "Medium source ear was extracted from its unwanted head; body native ears, eyes and tail were removed before the accepted HIGH views. Body-v2 unifies only the Medium sculpt guide to prevent generated hard plates; the final body is the new 50,000-triangle HIGH-v2 output.",
    "Actual generated hooves split along shared edge rings, sole levelled and interdigital cleft deepened. Seam vertices bind rigidly to the same foot bone.",
    "New HIGH single ear fits four positive-scale organic roots; new HIGH volumetric wool tail fits nine staggered curved eight-bone chains with embedded roots. Original HIGH surfaces, albedo and UVs retained for the organ copies.",
    "Two original authored dorsal eyes conform vertex-by-vertex to the actual HIGH back surface. Eye count, horizontal pupils, hornless sheep anatomy, coat palette and nonmagical calm display remain explicitly inferred.",
    "Independent cloned 98-bone rig, three clips, analytic baked leg IK and three convergent world-contact passes per frame. Real naturally running gait QA skins all sole vertices in XYZ and derives sole-plane normal and direction."
  ],
